From f4fa53021d154cb99906f7325056b421bcb92d08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anders Madsen <madsenanders97@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:29:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] blazer nfc (hk-nfc1): ST21NFC on the haptics bus,
 blazer_nfc=1..4 (pads, probe + power-up CORE_RESET_NTF versions, NCI init, RF
 discovery)

cli10 bus lock shared with blazer_haptic (ID stage and each ROM effect; a tap while NFC holds the bus is EBUSY, skipped).
research/ios26-nfc-r1/DESIGN.md

src-sha256: 69a1a54deb799b9f9494648b4a4bfb959ce2048d99375bd021a79326d402bf36
